Package: adblock
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AdBlock maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, adduser
Homepage: https://github.com/PankajKrana/dnsward
Description: System-wide ad and tracker blocking
 AdBlock blocks advertising and tracking domains for the whole system with a
 local filtering DNS resolver (DNS-over-HTTPS upstreams) and provides browser
 extensions for in-page filtering. No telemetry; statistics stay local.
 .
 After installation, run "sudo adblock enable" to turn protection on.
